# Function spacing

Leave one blank line between function definitions, including class methods and
Objective-C++ functions. Keep declarations grouped when appropriate.

The root `.clang-format` enforces this with `SeparateDefinitionBlocks: Always`.
Run `make -C backend format` after edits and `make -C backend check` before
finishing C++ changes.

```cpp
void first() {
  work();
}

void second() {
  more_work();
}
```
